From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ilya Vysotsky <il.mohoff2016@yandex.ru>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 00:48:19 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] Diagnostics: how WebRender composes a frame with a video in
 it

Every 300 composites: whether the video was an underlay (drawn first, with
every tile over it blended on top through a cut-out) or an overlay (drawn
over the page, occluding what is behind it), why it was refused as an
overlay, and how much of the screen a frame clears, draws opaque and draws
blended -- the overdraw a fullscreen video pays for.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
